FerrionOS change to the kernel (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit e7f1d4231d0f4b55fbef229d9cd9459302c101f4 with the patches before it in the recipe's list applied:
- fast-path FUTEX_WAKE for private user-accessible memory (Provider::Allocated with has_user()): keep the USER_END_OFFSET bound check and read-lock-before-FUTEXES lock order, build the exact FutexKey::Private key used by FUTEX_WAIT under the address-space read lock without taking the write lock in try_correcting_page_tables or walking page tables, and let every other grant (PROT_NONE, unmapped, shared) fall through to the existing path.

